RATIONALE: The L0 honestly proved the core system mechanism fails (deprioritization reclaims 0 slots; kill-on-flag harms more completed turns than it reclaims at achievable AUC). The novelty is at risk because it reduces to generic preemption. A green vote is given for a clean, rigorously constructed negative result that prevents further wasted effort on the deprioritization mechanism.
